762 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 115 0 R
/T (The key learning is that ethical hacking is defined not only by technical skill but also by permission, boundaries, accountability and responsible communication. Written authorization identifies who can test which assets, when and by what methods. Legal and privacy controls protect the university and the people whose information is stored in its systems. The isolated lab provides a safe place for practical learning, while reusable documents and a central register make the process repeatable. )
/E (The key learning is that ethical hacking is defined not only by technical skill but also by permission, boundaries, accountability and responsible communication. Written authorization identifies who can test which assets, when and by what methods. Legal and privacy controls protect the university and the people whose information is stored in its systems. The isolated lab provides a safe place for practical learning, while reusable documents and a central register make the process repeatable. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
